    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 55,
      "zh": "夜晚的霓虹公园，你和一只橘猫站上跷跷板，角度超过 22° 持续过久就会有人摔下去",
      "en": "In a neon park at night, you and an orange cat stand on a seesaw; if the angle stays above 22° too long, someone falls off"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 56,
      "zh": "A / D 或 ← / → 沿木板移动；W 增重、S 减重，共三档，越重体型越大",
      "en": "A / D or ← / → to move along the plank; W adds weight, S reduces it, three levels, heavier means bigger"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 57,
      "zh": "板身倾斜时你会自己往下滑，必须主动走位抵消；橘猫会随机散步、坐下打盹增重",
      "en": "When the board tilts you slide downhill and must move to counter it; the orange cat wanders randomly and sits down for naps, gaining weight"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 58,
      "zh": "点击掉落的鱼和毛线球捡起给猫，它会开心地跑向中心；保持近水平可获得完美平衡奖分",
      "en": "Click fish and yarn balls that drop to pick them up for the cat, who happily runs to the center; stay near level for perfect-balance bonus points"
    },
